<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My heart has no desire to stay,</l><l>On hardened ground, in the world’s way.</l><l>Satan no more shall steal Your Word,</l><l>I’ll move my heart where You are heard!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I want to deal with rocks in me,</l><l>From hidden sins, I would be free.</l><l>My heart I would clear up through prayer,</l><l>I’ll gain more depth to root You there!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The choking thorns, us barren make,</l><l>The life seed soon they’ll overtake.</l><l>Riches, anxiety reject,</l><l>Just for God’s growth the ground protect!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The sun must shine for us to grow,</l><l>So persecution we will know.</l><l>When it seems more than we can bear,</l><l>Lord, help us drink You deeply there!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>We want to grow to utmost height,</l><l>Until Your Body comes in sight.</l><l>Yourself in man will then be shown;</l><l>Your plan at last by all be known!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
